      "rationale": "Add one jointly learned scalar carry gate per GRU layer, initialized to alpha=0.9. Each recurrent update blends the previous hidden state with the standard GRU update, potentially retaining interests through noisy interactions. Preserve padding processing, embeddings, readout, scoring, loss, optimizer, and one checkpoint per category.",
